# Environment for an ANONYMOUS Resume Matcher instance.
# Copy to resume-matcher.anon.env (git-ignored) on the VPS.
#
# Deliberately no LLM_API_KEY: an anonymous visitor must not be able to spend your model
# budget. The app handles a missing key by pointing at its own Settings page, where the
# visitor pastes their own. If you would rather fund a shared demo key, add it here and
# accept that any visitor can spend it — the app's only cap is global per instance.

LLM_PROVIDER=
LLM_MODEL=
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
